WEBVTT

00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:00.449
That's not what we're doing here,

00:02:00.491 --> 00:02:02.285
we're looking, this is about looking.

00:02:02.285 --> 00:02:04.996
Everybody's going to be terrible,
I promise, don't worry.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:07.832
You're going to draw each other
with two very simple rules.

00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:10.835
One, you are never going to lift
your pencil up off the paper.

00:02:10.835 --> 00:02:12.044
One continuous line.

00:02:12.086 --> 00:02:13.462
No, no, trust me here.

00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:15.965
This is about looking, OK?

00:02:16.007 --> 00:02:18.176
So one continuous line
never lift the pencil.

00:02:18.217 --> 00:02:19.385
Number two,

00:02:19.427 --> 00:02:24.932
never, ever, ever look down
at the paper you're drawing on, OK?

00:02:24.974 --> 00:02:26.350
Yes, it's about looking.

00:02:26.392 --> 00:02:29.312
So keep looking at the person
you're drawing.

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:33.858
Now put your pencil down in
the middle of the paper, OK?